3
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.710
Yeah, and you learned something, right?

4
00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.280
I learned a ton of stuff.

5
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.830
A lot of people get their news on Twitter,

6
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:10.850
different platforms.

7
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:14.360
I love Instagram for a multitude of reasons

8
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:19.360
but I learned that the incredible artist, David Hockney,

9
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:22.110
