10
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:26.030
to the public in this super innovative way.

11
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.090
Okay. He's created this beautiful, hopeful

12
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.510
digital animation of a bright sunrise,

13
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:35.160
and it will be played on huge billboards in cities

14
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.450
around the world.

15
00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.310 line:15%
And it just is a really fun seamless way

16
00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:42.100 line:15%
