20
00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.610 line:15%
Would this have happened without the pandemic

21
00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:56.940
and museums closing.

22
00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:00.550
Would people say how do we experience art,

23
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:04.520
and listen, going to art museums is not for everybody.

24
00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:07.160
And some people think it's kind of bougie

25
00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:10.020
or maybe I'm not into this or you know that.

26
00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:14.400
And also why is an art museum so precious?

27
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.270
Why do you have to pay and go in

28
00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.080
