29
00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.070
I see the argument on both sides.

30
00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.440
I am a museum goer.

31
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.260
I am an art obsessed person.

32
00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.090
I've traveled the world going to museums.

33
00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:29.430
But what I love about this is the lack of preciousness.

34
00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:32.090
The lack of like, you have to do it this way.

35
00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:34.586
This is all about accessibility.

36
00:01:34.586 --> 00:01:35.419
That's it.

37
00:01:35.419 --> 00:01:37.890
Free, it doesn't cost anything.

38
00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.540
It's just creating beauty.

39
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:40.930
I'm just, I'm excited.

40
00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:43.170
I hope more things come about in the world like this.

41
00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:45.500
And I think it is because of what we've been through.

42
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.800
People have been forced to be innovative

43
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.820
